right. All right. This is going to be a thing.&nbsp;
And you're right. If there were a game of match,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:37:40.600 --> 00:37:49.040
match the face to this other profession on the&nbsp;
other side in column B, this is not to detract&nbsp;&nbsp;

