01:03:24.760 --> 01:03:30.286
anything that is me alone. I will always —
Tim Ferriss: That's a great policy.&nbsp;

01:03:30.286 --> 01:03:31.440
Soman Chainani: Yeah.
Tim Ferriss: I just want to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:31.440 --> 01:03:36.840
emphasize how good a decision that is. A lot of&nbsp;
friends I know who have embraced more recreational&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:36.840 --> 01:03:39.187
use have become addicted to ketamine.
Soman Chainani: Oh, I'm sure.&nbsp;

01:03:39.187 --> 01:03:46.360
Tim Ferriss: It has that potential. And you're&nbsp;
also, in a sense, a great candidate/profile&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:47.360 --> 01:03:52.880
