01:05:28.437 --> 01:05:29.960
Soman Chainani: It's just —
Tim Ferriss: Music? No music?&nbsp;

01:05:29.960 --> 01:05:30.904
Soman Chainani: Oh, no music.
Tim Ferriss: Visuals?&nbsp;

01:05:30.904 --> 01:05:38.560
Soman Chainani: Nothing. And it's alone. There's&nbsp;
