01:06:02.480 --> 01:06:05.040
you're going to have a little moment.
Tim Ferriss: That's when the traffic&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:05.040 --> 01:06:09.200
helicopters circle the traffic jam.
Soman Chainani: And then you have to — but I just&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:09.200 --> 01:06:15.560
think it's over time because I've been willing to&nbsp;
sort of do the work and sort of be in there with&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:15.560 --> 01:06:21.280
it. It's been a huge thing. And it meant that&nbsp;
I never had to take antidepressants. I never&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:21.280 --> 01:06:26.480
had to take anti-anxiety medication, things that&nbsp;
someone in my profile probably would've needed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:27.960 --> 01:06:35.280
But instead to go three, four times a year and do&nbsp;
these sessions, I think, and it's also — the great&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:35.280 --> 01:06:42.440
thing about it is it's a short half-life. It's&nbsp;
over so fast. So I think that's what makes it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:42.440 --> 01:06:45.640
has been such a huge contributor for me.
Tim Ferriss: How long would you say&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:45.640 --> 01:06:47.907
