Soman Chainani: One hour.&nbsp;

01:06:47.907 --> 01:06:51.000
Tim Ferriss: One hour.
Soman Chainani: Exactly one hour. And then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:51.000 --> 01:06:55.320
just the process of it getting out of your system,&nbsp;
you coming back up, all that stuff is probably&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:06:55.320 --> 01:07:01.947
another hour and a half. So, by the time you're&nbsp;
