01:07:01.947 --> 01:07:05.880
Tim Ferriss: Some interesting applications&nbsp;
to treatment-resistant depression and&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:05.880 --> 01:07:07.987
chronic pain also.
Soman Chainani: Yeah.&nbsp;

01:07:07.987 --> 01:07:15.600
Tim Ferriss: I did six infusions several years&nbsp;
ago, and I came in without any particular acute&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:15.600 --> 01:07:17.827
state of anxiety or depression.
Soman Chainani: Yeah.&nbsp;

01:07:17.827 --> 01:07:23.920
Tim Ferriss: So, the people working&nbsp;
there, the staff and technicians and&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:07:24.520 --> 01:07:32.520
MDs and so on were a little mystified. And&nbsp;
