more reason, and so I just watched it, because&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:15:20.000 --> 01:15:23.880
I'd also been hearing good things, and I love&nbsp;
sports talks. I just feel like it's the closest&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:15:23.880 --> 01:15:26.800
thing I can feel to high-performance stress.
Tim Ferriss: You've played a lot of tennis,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:15:26.800 --> 01:15:31.560
