01:16:57.800 --> 01:17:04.640
of them is so different. Mahomes is just sort of a&nbsp;
physical freak of nature and so smart and able to,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:17:04.640 --> 01:17:08.080
on the fly, improvise. And so, he's&nbsp;
very kind of — I think of him as almost&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:17:08.080 --> 01:17:13.120
pliable. He's very spongy. He can sort&nbsp;
of move and adjust at the last minute,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:17:13.120 --> 01:17:19.560
and he's so sort of confident in that ability.
Kirk Cousins is more like me where he's not&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:17:19.560 --> 01:17:25.920
particularly physically adept, but he's brainy&nbsp;
and nerdy. And so, where the other quarterbacks&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:17:25.920 --> 01:17:31.400
